add('9-038','Explain which material meets a sliding fitting’s wear requirement. Replacement is required above 0.50 mm wear. In tests under the same load and rubbing distance, pure iron wears by 0.80 mm and an iron alloy by 0.20 mm.','The iron alloy meets the requirement because its 0.20 mm wear is below 0.50 mm; pure iron exceeds the limit at 0.80 mm.','Choose the alloy and compare its 0.20 mm wear with the 0.50 mm limit; a bare material name earns no mark (1).',ao=['B'],subtype='APP')
